  #8 provider-protocol ──► #7 consolidation                                                                  │
        └────────────────► #6 ELPS-coverage (refactor onto the one protocol)                                 │
  #9 coupling-hygiene ───► #7  (HITL: migrate onto governed verbs BEFORE layering OPP-2/4)                   │
  #11-min release ──────► (makes every micro-release DoD-shippable; gates nothing technical but is a         │
                          program prerequisite for "DoD at end of each release")                            │
                                                                                                            │
  #1 EXP-OBS ═══════════► agent-relevance-signal + reward-log + transparent router (HARD; see I-1 below)     │
  #10 telemetry ────────► better eval for all M-work; head of the real-gold loop; feeds EXP-AF              │
                                                                                                            │
  #2 EXP-S (kind-tag schema) ═══► EXP-Fr in-library dispatcher (HARD; long pole; see I-2 below)             │
        ├──► #16 F5 (coordinate the two schema migrations in one release)                                   │
        └──► coverage-node / graph row-kinds (router substrate)                                             │
  #16 F5 ◄── ADR already ratified (cond. on 0.8.3 15b-proxy + Mem0 gap)                                     │
