                                                                                                            │
  #3 GPU ──► #4 ONNX (extends resolve_device(); rework-forcing — see I-3 below)                             │
  #3,#4 ──► #5 vector-equivalence (the guard only matters once ≥2 backends can read each other's index)     │
  #11-min ──► #11-full publish matrix                                                                        │
  #13 benchmark-harness ◄── needs perf/bench substrate (benches/, scale.rs, tracing feature) — author late  │
                                                                                                            │
  PLANNER-ROUTER eval chain:  EXP-A,EXP-M4 ──► EXP-B′ ──► EXP-Fr ;  EXP-Fr-acc ──► EXP-Fr ;                  │
