## 3. Out-of-band proposal (odd micro numbers)

OOB = $0 eval/analysis or a flag-gated/byte-stable drop-in, landable into the repo anytime, runnable by a
parallel agent track. **The odd line carries two kinds of OOB work:** (a) the original non-measure
drop-ins (#3 GPU, #12/#14 CI), and (b) the **planner-router $0 experiment ladder**, which co-resides on
